# Build context for docker/scheduler.Dockerfile. BuildKit reads the
# `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` sitting next to the Dockerfile, so the repo root
# stays free of a global ignore file.
#
# Kept: crates/, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, dashboard/ sources. Everything else is
# either a build output or belongs to an SDK the server does not compile.
.git/
target/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/.venv/
dashboard/dist/
docs/
junk/
sdks/java/
sdks/node/
sdks/python/
